# 本地跑 py_compile 会产生
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# send-email.py --preview 的默认输出目录；带前导斜杠是刻意的：
# 不带斜杠的模式会匹配任意层级，连 docs/email-preview/ 这种要提交的产物也一起挡掉
# [EN] The leading slash is deliberate: without it the pattern matches at any depth and
# would also ignore docs/email-preview/, which is committed on the build branch
/email-preview/
